# United Strength Brand Tokens

Read `.cursor/skills/united-strength-brand/SKILL.md` for full brand context. Status: **approved** — Culture Club Editorial (v5).

## CSS variables (required)

Define these in your global stylesheet or `:root`. Use semantic names — never hardcode hex in components.

```css
:root {
  /* Colors — The Culture Club (ALD-primary) */
  --color-bg-primary: #FFFFFF;
  --color-bg-secondary: #F3EEE7;
  --color-bg-warm: #F7F7F7;
  --color-bg-dark: #181818;
  --color-text-primary: #181818;
  --color-text-muted: #5C5C5C;
  --color-text-on-dark: #FFFFFF;
  --color-accent: #0A3C2E;
  --color-accent-spare: #D43F21;
  --color-border-editorial: #D9D9D9;

  /* Typography — Satoshi Bold (Fontshare, self-hosted) */
  --font-brand: "Satoshi", "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
  --font-primary: var(--font-brand);
  --font-editorial: "Instrument Serif", "Libre Baskerville", Georgia, serif;
  --font-caption: "IBM Plex Mono", ui-monospace, monospace;

  /* Spacing rhythm */
  --space-section: 120px;
  --space-block: 48px;

  /* Motion */
  --transition-slow: 700ms ease;
}
```

## Rules

1. **No hardcoded hex** in component files — use `var(--color-*)` only.
2. **No Inter, Roboto, or Space Grotesk** — Work Sans is the Sohne substitute.
3. **Forest green (`--color-accent`)** — membership CTAs only, not global accent.
4. **CTA copy** must match the brand skill — "Apply for Membership", not "Sign Up".
5. **Type:** body 12–16px with restrained tracking on small copy; nav labels 10px uppercase.
6. **Motion:** CSS transitions 600–800ms ease; no bouncy defaults.
7. **Images:** full-bleed heroes use `object-fit: cover`; photography leads, type follows (ALD rule).

## When tokens change

Update this file and `.cursor/skills/united-strength-brand/SKILL.md` together via `website-brand-foundation` iteration mode.
